        "start": 560.76,
        "end": 563.76,
        "english": "Praxis is a big beer drinker.",
        "chinese": "普拉西是大啤酒饮用者。"
    },
    {
        "start": 563.76,
        "end": 570.96,
        "english": "And this is the perfect opportunity to tell everyone about the world renowned beer shake.",
        "chinese": "这是向全世界宣传世界上最著名的啤酒冰沙的最佳机会。"
    },
    {
        "start": 570.96,
        "end": 571.96,
        "english": "Oh my gosh.",
        "chinese": "哎呀，哈！"
    },
    {
        "start": 571.96,
        "end": 572.96,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 572.96,
        "end": 573.96,
        "english": "Uh, okay.",
        "chinese": "抱歉，我不太明白您的意思。如果您有其他问题或需要帮助，请随时告诉我！"
