    },
    {
        "start": 628.2399999999999,
        "end": 630.4399999999999,
        "english": "And in the end they're like, wow, this is actually pretty good.",
        "chinese": "最后他们确实像，真是不错。"
    },
    {
        "start": 630.4399999999999,
        "end": 633.3599999999999,
        "english": "So did you invent this recipe?",
        "chinese": "所以你发明了这个食谱？"
    },
    {
        "start": 633.36,
        "end": 638.08,
        "english": "It's actually really common in Ecuador and Peru.",
