    },
    {
        "start": 638.08,
        "end": 641.24,
        "english": "I've even seen it in Chile, usually with a dark beer.",
        "chinese": "我甚至在智利见过它，通常与浓烈的啤酒一起。"
    },
    {
        "start": 641.24,
        "end": 642.24,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 642.24,
        "end": 643.24,
        "english": "Right?",
        "chinese": "是的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 643.24,
        "end": 644.24,
        "english": "So like a Guinness or?",
        "chinese": "所以像吉尼斯或？"
